 479            /ROUTINE TO SEE IF THERE IS ENOUGH TEXT BUFFER SPACE TO COMPLETE
 480            /A GIVEN OPERATION. ROUTINE ENTERED WITH C(ACC)= NUMBER OF LOCATIONS
 481            /NEEDED FOR THE OPERATION. ROUTINE TAKES EXIT 2 IF THERE IS ENOUGH
 482            /SPACE;RINGS BELL 5 TIMES AND TAKES EXIT 1 IF NOT ENOUGH SPACE.
 483            /THIS ROUTINE IS PAGE INDEPENDENT BUT CANNOT BE USED AS A PAGE 
 484            /BOUNDRY BUFFER.
